WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.648
This query combines Modules 11 and 12 The view owns
the

00:00:05.675 --> 00:00:11.260
stable patient-admission interface The CTEs own
report-specific

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:17.361
sequence and readmission logic LAG calculates the
previous discharge

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:25.099
The final threshold checks whether the gap is within
thirty days This separation

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:30.625
keeps the stable data interface reusable while
allowing reports to define their own analytical
rules
